# Personal identifier block list — one grep-E pattern per line.
# Copy this file to .githooks/.blocked and fill in your own patterns.
# .blocked is gitignored and is never committed or pushed.
#
# Syntax: extended regular expressions, matched case-insensitively.
# One pattern per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# ── Name variants ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Your Name
# Your\.Lastname
#
# ── Email / org ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# yourname\.handle
# yourcompany\.com
# YourCompany
#
# ── Username aliases ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# your_username
# your_alias
